//! OOXML (Excel) spellings, applied after every category has registered.
//!
//! One table instead of per-site `.ooxml()` calls: many add-in definitions
//! are generated by macros, and the table mirrors the `ooxml_name` column of
//! `docs/functions/master-list.toml` (the `OOXML_*` tables in
//! `docs/functions/gen-master-list.py`); `registry_matches_master_list`
//! checks the two agree. Built-ins whose Excel name equals the canonical
//! name need no entry ([`Registry::lookup_ooxml`] falls back to it).

use crate::registry::Registry;

